---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import profilePhoto from "../assets/profile.png";
import { contactEmail, projectLinks, socialLinks } from "../config";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <section>
    <Image
      src={profilePhoto}
      alt="Liam Lindner"
      class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 block lg:mt-5 mt-0 lg:mb-5 mb-10 mx-auto sm:float-right sm:ml-5 sm:mb-5 sm:grayscale sm:hover:grayscale-0"
      width={160}
      height={160}
    />

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert">
      <p>
        I'm Liam, an entrepreneur living in San Francisco. I've spent the past 20 years working in tech: as a co-founder, a software engineer and sales engineer, a manager and tech lead. Now I collaborate with organizations on projects that align with human flourishing.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-8 mb-0 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Currently:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Running a life coaching business. Coaching for a well-rounded life.
          <a href={projectLinks.coaching} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="liameveryday">liameveryday.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Building Consensus Builder, an app that lets groups make decisions over text instead of sitting in meetings.
          <a href={projectLinks.killTheMeeting} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="substack_post">Substack post</a> ·
          <a href={projectLinks.consensusBuilder} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="consensus_builder">consensusbuilder.app</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Performing in Dream Collective, an improv troupe. We interview an audience member about their day, then make up a dream version of it on stage.
          <a href={projectLinks.dreamCollective} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="dream_collective">Instagram</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Teaching Improv at <a href={projectLinks.leela} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="leela">Leela Improv Theatre</a> in San Francisco.
        </li>
        <li>
          Building an audience on <a href={socialLinks.tiktok} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="tiktok">TikTok</a> and <a href={socialLinks.instagram} target="_blank" data-track="project_link" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="instagram">Instagram</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} data-track="contact_email" data-track-surface="home_bio" data-track-label="drop_me_a_line">Drop me a line</a>. I'd love to hear about what you're working on.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
